{"content":"The pass is closed until day 5 — it's day 1. Pushing at the rocks is wasted time. Best plan: read the notice board (confirms schedule, useful info), then spend the days productively farming the meadow soil, and be ready at the pass on the morning of day 5.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_B3OmjOz4Zfadhjn0E3r89616","name":"submit_plan","args":{"approach":"Pass is blocked until day 5 (wiki + notice board); so read the notice, then till/plant/water crops in the meadow to pass time, and camp near the pass gap so we can walk through the moment it opens.","steps":[{"kind":"walk_to","x":4,"y":7},{"kind":"interact","x":3,"y":7,"button":"left"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":10,"y":5},{"kind":"wait","minutes":5}]}}],"ms":2982,"cached":false,"usage":{"prompt":2022,"completion":700}}